    "goal": "流程：先看句意功能，再看結構，最後看搭配。例：___ Mei preferred remote work, she summarised both sides. 需要「讓步＋完整子句」，故用 Although，不是 Despite。",
    "article": "An online staff group was discussing whether the company should keep one remote-work day each week. Some employees supported the idea because it saved commuting time. Others preferred everyone to be in the office, where quick questions could be answered face to face. The discussion became less useful when people began repeating opinions without giving evidence.\n\nMei, who was responsible for collecting feedback, changed the format. She asked each person to state one benefit, one concern, and one possible solution. Although Mei personally preferred remote work, she summarised both sides fairly. She wrote, “We may not agree on the best schedule, but we agree that communication and customer service must remain strong.” This sentence shifted the focus from personal beliefs to a shared goal.\n\nThe group did not reach a final decision that day. However, it selected two schedules for a four-week trial. Mei's approach did not remove disagreement; it made the disagreement easier to examine peacefully. Being tolerant of a different opinion does not mean accepting every claim as true. It means listening, checking evidence, and responding to the point rather than attacking the person.",
    "listening": "Manager: We need to decide whether the help desk should close at six or stay open until eight.\nStaff A: I prefer six because the evening is usually quiet.\nStaff B: I disagree. Recent messages indicate that several customers need support after work.\nManager: Let's not decide from preference alone. Could each of you review last month's call data and suggest a schedule tomorrow?\nStaff A: That's fair. We may still disagree, but we'll have evidence to discuss.",
    "grammarNote": "• 流程：先看句意功能，再看結構，最後看搭配。例：___ Mei preferred remote work, she summarised both sides. 需要「讓步＋完整子句」，故用 Although，不是 Despite。\n• 常錯：只看到 remote work 就選 because；忽略後句公平呈現的轉折。\n• 辨認：___ the disagreement, they ran a trial. A Although B Despite。無提示：選出能連接「資料不足→先測試」的連接詞。遷移：替兩個方案寫一個證據鏈。",
