    "goal": "先刪插入片語：The supervisor, along with two assistants, is...。each/every + 單數名詞 + 單數動詞。",
    "article": "The warehouse has both flexible guidelines and non-negotiable safety rules. Employees may choose when to take a short break, provided that their work area remains covered. However, everyone is required to wear an identification card, and visitors must be accompanied by a staff member. Neither new employees nor experienced managers are allowed to enter the loading area without safety shoes.\n\nThese systems are in place for a reason. Last year, a visitor walked behind a moving vehicle because no one had explained the marked route. After the incident, signs were added and the visitor policy was revised. Each supervisor, along with two assistants, is responsible for checking the area at the start of a shift. The phrase along with two assistants adds information, but the grammatical subject is still each supervisor, so the verb is singular. Employees who do not comply with the policy may lose access to the area. The aim is not to get people in trouble; it is to prevent an avoidable accident.",
    "listening": "Welcome to the production area. Before your shift begins, please review the safety procedure. Protective glasses are non-negotiable near the cutting machines. Mobile phones may be used in the break room, but they must be stored in a locker on the factory floor. If a machine stops, do not restart it unless a supervisor gives permission. Report the problem and wait behind the yellow line. These rules apply to both permanent staff and temporary workers.",
